  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 701.02 Applicability. The requirements of this chapter shall apply to any lake level investigation initiated pursuant to RSA 482:79.\n\nSource. #4278, eff 6-30-87; ss by #5662, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED: 7-1-99\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
